MATRIX: Fibonacci. The Matrix does not want you to know the sequence.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE fib WITH n
  IF n IS LESS THAN 2 THEN
    CASH OUT n
  PERIOD
  CASH OUT (CALL fib WITH (n MINUS 1)) PLUS (CALL fib WITH (n MINUS 2))
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN 12
  WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL fib WITH i
  BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
STOP GRINDING

BACK TO THE MATRIX
